### How to load programs.
@load 'frontend/some.prog'  # backend/ is the stdlib found in ./backend/
@load './this.prog'      # relative to wherever you ran bin/prog from (cwd)
@load 'that.prog'        # relative to wherever you ran bin/prog from (cwd)
@load 'and_this'         # no .prog extension required
###
